# v091/measure-m4 merge of master 8086a6a. Caps record the probe immediate;
# a function fails the check when its frame exceeds its cap or has no cap
# at all; lower caps as frames shrink.
# Symbol names re-keyed to the ADR-12 layout (C7); caps unchanged.
#
# Re-measured at 941c1db (CI-QUALITY) on a -Dcpu=baseline build, matching the
# quality job: native codegen differs by a few bytes between hosts, so the job
# pins baseline to keep caps host-independent. The job died at the dane-zig
# dependency fetch on every run since 2616, so reviewed merges grew these
# frames without the ratchet ever firing. Each raised cap is intentional
# work, not an accident:
